# 160 x 24 x 24 float64 = 737,280 bytes of payload -- the whole bank is
# 365x smaller than the two ignored DNS artefacts, and it is what removes the
# 3.44 h per-shard DNS prerequisite above. The big artefacts stay ignored.
!seedbank/
!seedbank/**
